OL,3,GNEWSAPair held in Iran seen by UK
OL,4,Aofficials after 112 days
OL,5,
OL,6,FA British couple who have been detained
OL,7,Fin Iran for more than 20 months have
OL,8,Fbeen seen by UK officials for the first
OL,9,Ftime in 112 days, their family have
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FLindsay and Craig Foreman, who were
OL,13,Fsentenced to 10 years in jail over
OL,14,Fespionage charges which they deny, have
OL,15,Fnow been visited at Evin Prison after
OL,16,Fmonths without consular access.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
