OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPair held in Iran seen by UK
OL,4,Aofficials after 112 days
OL,5,
OL,6,FAccording to Lindsay's son, Joe
OL,7,FBennett, the couple are now in better
OL,8,Fspirits, with Craig telling officials
OL,9,Fhe had regained around 1.6 stone (10kg)
OL,10,Fof the 2.7 stone (17kg) lost following
OL,11,Fa hunger strike the couple ended in
OL,12,FAugust.
OL,14,FThe Foreign, Commonwealth & Development
OL,15,FOffice (FCDO) has been contacted for
OL,16,Fcomment.
